<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE -ARGENTINE BANCO DEL SUQUIA YR NET $7.68 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE -ARGENTINE BANCO DEL SUQUIA YR NET $7.68 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30.</p>
<p>Net $7.68 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Banco del Suquia provided neither comparitive, EPS nor ADR information. It did not detail fourth quarter results.</p>
<p>The bank reported a net worth of $125 million and retained earnings of $21.34 million.</p>
<p>It also said the board proposed the distribution of $1.15 million in cash dividends and $4.6 million in share dividends.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
